.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH pdfluent 1  "pdfluent 1.0.0-beta.1" 
.SH NAME
pdfluent \- PDF and XFA form processing toolkit
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpdfluent\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
PDF and XFA form processing toolkit
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
pdfluent\-render(1)
Render PDF pages to PNG images
.TP
pdfluent\-extract(1)
Extract text from PDF pages
.TP
pdfluent\-fill(1)
Fill AcroForm fields from a JSON file
.TP
pdfluent\-flatten(1)
Flatten form fields (remove interactive elements)
.TP
pdfluent\-info(1)
Display PDF document information
.TP
pdfluent\-validate(1)
Validate PDF against compliance profiles (PDF/A, PDF/UA)
.TP
pdfluent\-sign(1)
Validate digital signatures in a PDF
.TP
pdfluent\-doctor(1)
Check installation and system environment
.TP
pdfluent\-completions(1)
Generate shell completions
.TP
pdfluent\-man(1)
Generate man pages
.TP
pdfluent\-demo(1)
Run the XFA engine demo pipeline
.TP
pdfluent\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v1.0.0\-beta.1
